From: Oleksii Kulinich <entaytion@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:31:12 +0300
Subject: Add confirm-before-sending prompts for voice, stickers and GIFs

- CONFIRM_SEND_VOICE / CONFIRM_SEND_STICKER / CONFIRM_SEND_GIF, each
  independently toggleable, default off
- voice/video notes: yes/no prompt, also when sent straight from
  recording (pauses like the stock paid-message flow)
- stickers/GIFs: open the stock long-press preview with its send menu
